":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdubVBeA","review_id":"NmmgOfozN7LVnV8JLTRC1g","date":"2018-01-08T17:41:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9431470036506653,"text_excerpt":"So excited about all the Gracious Bakeries popping up all over the city. While the love of my life has the sweetest of tooths, I love me some savory pastries and Gracious is packin' heat. The first time I visited this location they had some bacon carb-y deliciousness that had the bacon all sorts of baked in. It was like a bountiful easter egg hunt for bacon pieces hidden in the layers of flaky dough. The next time I enjoyed some other form of savory goodness since \"Hidden Bacon Treasures\" wasn't made that day. I like that they mix it up. I've also ordered lunch there, and sweet baby Jesus, the bread does make a difference. I had the Smoked Turkey, and I was awkwardly \"mmm\"ing over it...bu..."},{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdubVBeA","review_id":"Xgb2hGswsasdKRnaBYPF7Q","date":"2019-01-04T15:46:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9314278364181519,"text_excerpt":"Today was my first time visiting Gracious Bakery. I am so happy that I did. It is close to my job so I know that I have many visits ahead of me. I had a small cappuccino and a ham and cheese croissant. First, the coffee was perfect. It was very smooth, frothy and the perfect temperature. I am glad I chose something different from my usual latte. There were a number of other coffees, pastries and breakfast sandwiches to choose from. They all looked fresh and delicious but I decided to get the ham and cheese croissant. I am so happy I did. It was perfectly buttery, light, flaky and cheesy....I really took my time and enjoyed it unlike other mornings when I am so famished that I gobble right..."},{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdubVBeA","review_id":"EqISAcTl1Bm1Ll16XG1RTQ","date":"2017-12-13T03:52:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9293588399887085,"text_excerpt":"Came here early Sunday morning on a recommendation by my favorite donut maker in NYC. She said that had great croissants, so I went with the chocolate, as well as a brownie and a red velvet cupcake. I'm a neater so we got everything to go so we could eat in our pajamas (and so I could nuke the croissant for 10 seconds because honestly, that's just the best way to eat them). I normally like my sweets a little sweeter than they serve them here (that's probably for the best, right?) but everything was interesting because of their textures. The brownie was super dense, in a good way, the cream cheese icing was slightly gluey in a weird way, and the croissant was nice and crispy on the outside..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdubVBeA","photo_id":"s3rYIXsEBA7H_srWBZcFjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/s3rYIXsEBA7H_srWBZcFjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9355812072753906},{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdubVBeA","photo_id":"usiJSVQWaujBlCevuRfSsA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/usiJSVQWaujBlCevuRfSsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9323064684867859},{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdubVBeA","photo_id":"DJGIip_srNg6J6nu81flgA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DJGIip_srNg6J6nu81flgA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9275435209274292},{"business_id":"IjtQu81tebi_pLWdub